{"posts":[{"id":"staurum_p1_1","t":"1st try 3:19pm 17 october 2016","a":"staurum","d":"17 Oct 2016 15:19","n":"#1","p":1,"im":["08382dde0f525fea047f1e1d11a3e0e879352b1b"],"fa":"اولین تلاش، 3:19pm 17 october 2016","m":54896},{"id":"staurum_p1_2","t":"Dissecting H4 Timeframe","a":"staurum","d":"17 Oct 2016 15:30","n":"#2","p":1,"im":["86d54fbd8399351bfaeb3f1e8b097d948d719929"],"fa":"کالبدشکافی تایم‌فریم H4","m":54897},{"id":"staurum_p1_3","t":"","a":"staurum","d":"18 Oct 2016 11:36","n":"#3","p":1,"im":["6d205b70e64384fc4de1f4eb47ece47c90b582a0"],"m":54920},{"id":"staurum_p1_4","t":"Supply zone in progress. We just had a few bullish impulses. So this\nshort might be a hedge trade only... For positioning, it is good to\nbargain for cheaper levels.","a":"staurum","d":"18 Oct 2016 15:39","n":"#4","p":1,"im":["2fd24359da224cc9672914e8ceabf1470abbeede"],"fa":"ناحیهٔ عرضه در حال شکل‌گیری است. همین حالا چند ایمپالس صعودی داشتیم. پس این پوزیشن فروش شاید فقط یک معاملهٔ هج باشد... برای پوزیشن‌گیری، خوب است برای سطوح ارزان‌تر چانه بزنیم.","m":54931},{"id":"staurum_p1_5","t":"hmm... SL got hit.... Demand zones in play for now.","a":"staurum","d":"18 Oct 2016 21:46","n":"#5","p":1,"im":["3999025904123101a8e252f4d406fa08b1799e8d"],"fa":"هوم... SL فعال شد.... فعلاً نواحی تقاضا بازی می‌کنند.","m":54935},{"id":"staurum_p1_6","t":"hi Staurum\n\nhere is some note hope it helps\n\nregards\n\nSalivan","a":"salivan","d":"18 Oct 2016 21:54","n":"#6","p":1,"im":["9ca7835b888ec3963823c1ebf463302c91cc13b5"],"fa":"سلام\n\nاین چند خط یادداشت است، امیدوارم به کارت بیاید\n\nبا احترام\n\nSalivan","m":54936},{"id":"staurum_p1_7","t":"Hi Salivan, Yes.... that recent eng... i did put a sell limit order but\ngot kicked out straight away by the stop hunters... not a good trade.\nBut i guess my guess was correct that they were hunting for the 1256 FTR\nlevel. and that was our FTB on 1256..\n\nMy aim for supply is at 1267-1268... i think we already exhausted supply at 1260-ish","a":"staurum","d":"19 Oct 2016 01:26","n":"#7","p":1,"im":["a42affc30d0c1c57116e9bb05327c8e45f4d3006"],"fa":"سلام Salivan. بله.... آن اینگالف اخیر... من یک سفارش لیمیت فروش گذاشتم، ولی همان لحظه شکارچیان استاپ بیرونم انداختند... معاملهٔ خوبی نبود. ولی حدس می‌زنم حدسم درست بود که دنبال سطح FTR 1256 می‌گشتند. و آن همان FTB ما روی 1256 بود..\n\nهدف من برای عرضه 1267-1268 است... فکر می‌کنم عرضه را همان حوالی 1260 تمام کرده‌ایم","m":54947},{"id":"staurum_p1_8","t":"hmm.... dilemma here. chase or not chase?","a":"staurum","d":"19 Oct 2016 13:38","n":"#8","p":1,"im":["a1e6c9cd1bed52ca9ab9dd4108eefe36d611c8fc"],"fa":"هوم.... اینجا دوراهی است. دنبالش بیفتم یا نه؟","m":54963},{"id":"staurum_p1_9","t":"Hmm.... QM in play. in supply zone.","a":"staurum","d":"19 Oct 2016 16:44","n":"#9","p":1,"im":["ea9130137335542f0580ee6e1ea08e923be6c0a8"],"fa":"هوم.... QM در جریان است. داخل ناحیهٔ عرضه.","m":54977},{"id":"staurum_p1_10","t":"ok.. lucky that QM thinking didnot come into fruition. now gold is at fresh supply. although there is a fresher zone up above.","a":"staurum","d":"19 Oct 2016 17:36","n":"#10","p":1,"im":["d493beeee2cfbacd5befe70439a5e5d2158051c8"],"fa":"باشه.. خوشبختانه فکر QM به نتیجه نرسید. حالا طلا روی عرضهٔ تازه است، هرچند بالاتر یک ناحیهٔ تازه‌تر هم هست.","m":54979},{"id":"staurum_p1_11","t":"Looks like a Diamond shape PA","a":"staurum","d":"20 Oct 2016 09:23","n":"#11","p":1,"im":["947b608244dd8415dd01846f368c8e7322acf7d7"],"fa":"به نظر یک PA به شکل دایموند است","m":55039},{"id":"staurum_p1_12","t":"","a":"staurum","d":"20 Oct 2016 13:25","n":"#12","p":1,"im":["6078e59d1924689507666133ed70afc779a72a4d","cf17f6d52b10f47fc4dc71a9e258652edd7bf089"],"m":55041},{"id":"staurum_p1_13","t":"","a":"staurum","d":"21 Oct 2016 11:20","n":"#13","p":1,"im":["9364bc259f1a6ec2830a644c910db995681cf52e"],"m":55082},{"id":"staurum_p1_14","t":"Daily: Past demand already, so direction is looking at the next Resistance.\n\nIntraday: could still play the S/R levels","a":"staurum","d":"26 Oct 2016 01:49","n":"#14","p":1,"im":["78c780e6b4f842fa6e556c26aa7d74b34673a611","63d201c1c529d1f1f9764e4c3eece1b394bcf9ad"],"fa":"روزانه: تقاضا دیگر پشت سر مانده، پس جهت به مقاومت بعدی نگاه می‌کند.\n\nاینترادی: هنوز می‌شود روی سطوح S/R بازی کرد","m":55339},{"id":"staurum_p1_15","t":"www.tradingview.com/x/IuBany4J/","a":"staurum","d":"07 Nov 2016 13:53","n":"#15","p":1,"im":[],"m":55981},{"id":"staurum_p1_16","t":"USDJPY has entered a very very interesting zone. I am waiting for an\nengulf of the last swing high, after which will be looking out for QM or\neven Diamond at FO at FTR111.90.","a":"staurum","d":"21 Nov 2016 09:44","n":"#16","p":1,"im":["013289ba6788d4f7793dfe552614bb239711887d"],"fa":"USDJPY وارد یک ناحیهٔ خیلی خیلی جالب شده است. منتظر اینگالف آخرین سقف سوئینگ هستم؛ بعد از آن دنبال QM یا حتی دایموند در FO روی FTR111.90 خواهم بود.","m":56663},{"id":"staurum_p1_17","t":"I've been watching UJ also.\n\nI'm looking for 111.8 area","a":"TheBeard","d":"21 Nov 2016 16:11","n":"#17","p":1,"im":[],"fa":"من هم UJ را زیر نظر داشتم.\n\nدنبال ناحیهٔ 111.8 هستم","m":56674},{"id":"staurum_p1_18","t":"","a":"staurum","d":"22 Nov 2016 09:14","n":"#18","p":1,"im":["a2002a58803b66e86a676e05fe2a9f28c7113409"],"m":56749},{"id":"staurum_p1_19","t":"","a":"staurum","d":"22 Nov 2016 09:49","n":"#19","p":1,"im":["ec0a4a925c59c5c3b19936a5bdc14f14253bfc43","70a8e82fcd0bbbe2cfb962dd7498a8c444473ebf","5beea00d270644c91a47b23102529b2205300d67"],"m":56751},{"id":"staurum_p1_20","t":"I have read RTM materials for over a month now, and i have a confession\nto make: the more i learn, the more i realise how much i do not know.\nThe more AHA moments I found, the more times I am discouraged by the\nmarket invalidating the AHA moments. Just when I yelled \"yes i knew it\",\nthe more the market will spank me \"nope, dont be so cocky, there s more\nto learn, here s us (the Market / ITs) taking your stoploss, go back to\nRTM and suck your losses up! then comeback here and challenge us\".\n\nFunny that lastnight, there was a \"Deadpool\" movie showing on my TV. The\nhard painful irony that i thought was : maybe all newbies are inherited\nwith the market-infected cancer. In order to cure the newbies, ones\nhave to through extreme gruelling sets of procedures (and please dont\nforget the pains) until the body (trader mindset) mutates to heal/cure\nitself. If not strong, you'll just burn and die. If succeeds, the ugly\nscars never leave forever. Blessing or curse? how rethoric.\n\nOk now, back to the chart. I have marked all the numbers to express my\nthought flow that follows the chart order flow. I am not going to write\ndown what i thought at each numbered checkpoint as I do not want to bore\nand discourage the true curious, truth/price-reading seeker.. Just to\nhelp those who are confused, please look at left when you come to any\ncheckpoint. Cheers, more to come later.","a":"staurum","d":"28 Nov 2016 10:46","n":"#20","p":1,"im":["24bc51f67626c6e186a87f184ebb1626af26ffb1"],"fa":"بیش از یک ماه است که مطالب RTM را می‌خوانم و باید یک اعتراف بکنم: هر چه بیشتر یاد می‌گیرم، بیشتر می‌فهمم که چقدر نمی‌دانم. هر چه لحظه‌های AHA بیشتری پیدا می‌کنم، بیشتر با باطل‌شدن آن لحظه‌ها به دست بازار دلسرد می‌شوم. درست همان وقت که داد می‌زنم «بله، می‌دانستم که»، بازار بیشتر شلاقم می‌زند: «نه، این‌قدر از خودت مطمئن نباش؛ چیزهای بیشتری برای یاد گرفتن هست؛ این هم ما (بازار / IT‌ها) که حد ضرر تو را می‌گیریم؛ برگرد سراغ RTM و ضررهایت را ببلع! بعد برگرد اینجا و ما را به چالش بکش».\n\nخنده‌دار اینکه دیشب Deadpool از تلویزیون پخش می‌شد. طنز تلخ و دردناکی که به ذهنم رسید این بود: شاید همهٔ تازه‌کارها سرطانِ بازار را به ارث برده‌اند. برای درمان تازه‌کارها، آدم باید از مجموعه‌ای از پروسه‌های به‌شدت طاقت‌فرسا بگذرد (و لطفاً دردهایش را هم فراموش نکنید) تا وقتی که بدن (ذهنیت معامله‌گر) جهش کند و خودش را درمان کند. اگر قوی نباشی، فقط می‌سوزی و می‌میری. اگر موفق شوی، آن زخم‌های زشت هرگز برای همیشه از بین نمی‌روند. نعمت است یا نفرین؟ چه پرسش بلاغی‌ای.\n\nخب، حالا برگردیم به نمودار. همهٔ شماره‌ها را علامت زده‌ام تا جریان فکری‌ام را که از جریان سفارش نمودار پیروی می‌کند نشان بدهم. قصد ندارم بنویسم در هر نقطهٔ شماره‌دار چه فکری کرده‌ام، چون نمی‌خواهم جستجوگر واقعاً کنجکاوِ حقیقت و خوانش قیمت را خسته و دلسرد کنم.. فقط برای کمک به کسانی که گیج شده‌اند: هر وقت به یکی از این نقاط رسیدید، سمت چپ را نگاه کنید. خوش باشید، بعداً بیشتر می‌نویسم.","m":57084},{"id":"staurum_p1_21","t":"Ah! i didnt check well enough.\n\nThe true MPL is here at 1m chart:\n\nNow the reaction shows","a":"staurum","d":"28 Nov 2016 11:05","n":"#21","p":1,"im":["11cb1c550154d25eb19b68bbb133e14afa55c812","4e85cc7018353db873e33b2db68db2cf74ac58d3"],"fa":"آه! به‌اندازهٔ کافی خوب بررسی نکردم.\n\nMPL واقعی اینجاست، در نمودار 1m:\n\nحالا واکنش نشان می‌دهد","m":57085},{"id":"staurum_p1_22","t":"Ah! i didnt check well enough.\n\nThe true MPL is here at 1m chart:\n\nNow the reaction shows\n\n(Look also how the approach is 3-Drive into MPL, or we can also say compression into MPL)","a":"staurum","d":"28 Nov 2016 11:06","n":"#22","p":1,"im":["11cb1c550154d25eb19b68bbb133e14afa55c812","4e85cc7018353db873e33b2db68db2cf74ac58d3"],"fa":"آه! به‌اندازهٔ کافی خوب بررسی نکردم.\n\nMPL واقعی اینجاست، در نمودار 1m:\n\nحالا واکنش نشان می‌دهد\n\n(نگاه کن که نزدیک‌شدن هم به شکل 3-Drive به سمت MPL است، یا می‌توانیم بگوییم فشرده‌سازی به داخل MPL)","m":57086},{"id":"staurum_p1_23","t":"","a":"staurum","d":"28 Nov 2016 16:45","n":"#23","p":1,"im":["4b31f1d68f550a4f05b3d52ee4dce2f5c3c8dc92"],"m":57106},{"id":"staurum_p1_24","t":"Update:\n\nFTR and FL established. A break below 1188 is crucial","a":"staurum","d":"29 Nov 2016 15:54","n":"#24","p":1,"im":["1f66759dddacb6b2290f0c08b6f705103dced156"],"fa":"به‌روزرسانی:\n\nFTR و FL تثبیت شدند. شکست زیر 1188 حیاتی است","m":57166},{"id":"staurum_p1_25","t":"","a":"staurum","d":"29 Nov 2016 23:56","n":"#25","p":1,"im":["988f19150f54a6b0f95c25dce18a267616839c8c"],"m":57215}],"images":[{"k":"08382dde0f525fea047f1e1d11a3e0e879352b1b","t":"assets/thumbs/08382dde0f525fea047f1e1d11a3e0e879352b1b.webp","f":"asset